{"availability":"available","full":"GeiserX/Personal-Genome-Pipeline","name":"Personal-Genome-Pipeline","description":"Whole genome sequencing analysis pipeline for consumer hardware. 100% local, Docker-powered, free and open source.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Shell","stars":14,"forks":2,"created":"2026-03-30T10:08:43Z","updated":"2026-10-09T02:28:17Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://geiserx.github.io/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/","topics":["ancestry","bioinformatics","cancer-predisposition","clinvar","deepvariant","docker","genomics","grch38","mitochondrial","personal-genomics","pharmacogenomics","pharmcat","pipeline","polygenic-risk-scores","structural-variants","telomere","variant-calling","vcf","wgs","whole-genome-sequencing"],"demo":"https://geiserx.github.io/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:27.843Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:27.843Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:27.843Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.395Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:27.843Z","stars":14,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Analyze your own whole genome sequencing (WGS) data on consumer hardware.","No cloud accounts, no subscriptions, no bioinformatics degree required.","This pipeline takes raw sequencing data (FASTQ/BAM/VCF) from any vendor and runs the analysis steps of a default run to produce a full genomic profile: variant calling, pharmacogenomics, structural variants, cancer predisposition screening, polygenic risk scores, ancestry estimation, telomere length, mitochondrial analysis, and more. Everything runs locally in Docker containers with resource limits so it won't crash your machine."],"features":["Takes FASTQ, BAM, VCF or Illumina ORA from any vendor (Nebula, Dante Labs, Sequencing.com, Novogene, DRAGEN), plus long reads from Nanopore and PacBio HiFi.","Calls SNPs and indels with DeepVariant, and structural and copy number variants with Manta, Delly and CNVpytor merged into a consensus.","Screens ClinVar and runs CPSR cancer predisposition panels, VEP annotation with CADD, SpliceAI, REVEL and AlphaMissense, and slivar prioritization.","Pharmacogenomics with PharmCAT, pypgx (23 genes, CYP2D6 SVs) and CPIC drug recommendations. PharmCAT gets T1K's HLA types, and a CYP2D6 call only when pypgx and Cyrius (opt-in, non-commercial licence) agree.","Repeat expansions, HLA typing (KIR opt-in), SMN1/SMN2 copy number (opt-in), telomere length, mitochondrial haplogroup and heteroplasmy, ROH, ancestry and polygenic risk scores."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aadbb1b084927766681a199484c9b4dbbe8678006a23f1bd7ba59db3f7fc586d","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.650Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.650Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Analyze your own whole genome sequencing (WGS) data on consumer hardware.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No cloud accounts, no subscriptions, no bioinformatics degree required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"aadbb1b084927766681a199484c9b4dbbe8678006a23f1bd7ba59db3f7fc586d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.650Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T02:09:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/Personal-Genome-Pipeline/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.650Z","hash":"aadbb1b084927766681a199484c9b4dbbe8678006a23f1bd7ba59db3f7fc586d","originalBytes":7965,"storedBytes":7965,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","pipeline","step","runs","bam","every","genome","reference","run","each","fas